flowchart TD
    A[Canonical LCQ queue] --> B[Expected producer]
    B --> C{Valid block inside slot?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Verify EVM result, seal, rewards, and LCQ rules]
    D --> E[Accept canonical block]
    C -- No --> F[Timeout and fallback window]
    F --> G[Next permitted queue position]
    G --> C
    G --> H{No eligible producer remains?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Chain waits without rewriting history]
    I --> J[Valid participation returns]
    J --> A
